From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: y4ssi <11613913+y4ssi@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 04 Nov 2026 01:26:53 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Let the host app gate the SDK's direct connections (images, web views)

FlexaClientConfiguration takes an optional directConnectionsAllowed, asked before the SDK connects
to Flexa outside the API clients okHttpClientCustomizer reaches. Every image goes through one Coil
ImageLoader (FlexaImageLoader) whose OkHttp client refuses the download while it returns false, so
the placeholder shows; every web view (merchant directory, how to pay, legal pages) is wrapped in
DirectConnectionConsent, which then shows a disclosure and loads the page only after the user agrees.
Null keeps upstream's behaviour (always allowed).
